    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Welcome to Foundry. Don't mind the foul air. ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ласкаво просимо до Foundry. Не звертайте уваги на сморідне повітря. ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>No more monsters! Yay!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Більше ніяких монстрів! Ура!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>The people have become really aggressive lately. ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Останнім часом люди стали дуже агресивними. ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>As if being a miner isn't already too difficult, we now have to deal with those freakin' monsters!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ніби бути шахтарем недостатньо важко, тепер нам ще й доводиться мати справу з цими кляті монстри!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>All booze tastes like muck after coming back from Drag and Drop.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Усе спиртне смакує як багно після повернення з Drag and Drop.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Pretty much everything tastes different around here. Food, water, medicine... ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Майже все тут має інший смак. Їжа, вода, ліки... ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Prison lockdown? Where is this world heading to?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Замкнення в'язниці? Куди котиться цей світ?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>My legs feel so friable right now.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Мої ноги зараз такі крихкі.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Avoid the slums. ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Уникайте нетрів. ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Hi, $(context.player.Name). How are you feelin'?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Привіт, $(context.player.Name). Як ти почуваєшся?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I heard about the Faceless attack on Rail Crossing. And now they're here!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я чув про атаку Безликих на Rail Crossing. І тепер вони тут!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q13" name="=&gt;q13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Whoa! Heard about Evelyn? ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ого! Чув про Евелін? ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q14" name="=&gt;q14">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">28</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Faceless'll never get through our walls.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Безликі ніколи не пройдуть крізь наші стіни.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
